# Refine advanced Production analysis

Improve cumulative probability rows, zero-production presentation, Dice reliance controls/scaling, and Grain contrast.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] Card subrows are 0, 1+, 2+, 3+, and 4+ cards and show the corresponding cumulative probabilities.
- [x] Rounds subrows are 2+, 3+, 4+, and 5+ rounds and show `p0`, `p0²`, `p0³`, and `p0⁴`.
- [x] Every expanded value is a dash when that player has no production for the resource.
- [x] Dice reliance uses a Production-balance-style single-select active-player picker.
- [x] Dice reliance labels are `Cards on roll` and `Expected production`, with matching help text.
- [x] Each Dice reliance mode scales independently so its largest bar reaches the chart maximum.
- [x] The chart has readable round-number y ticks, grid lines, and non-overlapping axis labels.
- [x] Grain yellow has sufficient light-mode contrast.
- [x] Domain and UI regression coverage compiles.

